{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10413110","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10413110","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041311001:1":{"text":"ブライアン、ボクにカブと豆のスープを渡してこないでよ……","source_cn":"布莱恩，不要递给我那份芜菁豆子汤……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09F31744F58ABAE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041311002:1":{"text":"騙されないよ！今日の厨房担当がカブだって言ってたのを、この耳で聞いたんだから！","source_cn":"别想蒙骗我！我亲耳听到今天掌厨的人说那是芜菁！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43034FE4FE776044","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041311003:1":{"text":"……君、聞き取り能力が上手くなったか？","source_cn":"……你对声音的掌控似乎有所提升？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E0408CCE4434CF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041311004:1":{"text":"言われてみればそうかもね！ルナーランドが静かだからかもしれないよ？","source_cn":"这么一说，好像是！也许是因为月影乡足够安静？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F0F437FF7C10114","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041311005:1":{"text":"つまり、君はこういうところにこもって訓練するのが向いてるんだな。","source_cn":"这么说，你比较适合隐居在这里锻炼自己的能力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE11FC495FFE83362","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docume